# Explore Tropical Hashing

Tropical arithmetic replaces addition by a minimum and multiplication by ordinary addition. Begin with the [tropical geometry overview](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tropical_geometry), then use the live exhibits below to see why optimization structure is not the same as cryptographic diffusion.

## 1. Build an output backward

A scalar keyed map sends a message to the smallest shifted coordinate. Its entire fiber is described by coordinate inequalities plus one active equality. The canonical construction makes every coordinate active.

