## Design lesson

A minimum is a powerful optimization summary precisely because it forgets losing alternatives. Secure designs need coupling, diffusion, a precise finite encoding, and a stated adversarial model. Learn more about the distinct goals of [cryptographic hash functions](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cryptographic_hash_function) before comparing evaluation timings or output formats.
